    "updated_at": "2021-09-17T14:17:00Z",
    "body": "The root cause is that there are the library size is too big. You can just choose SM that you need to use. You can also just choose the kernels you want. We support simple regular expressions when selecting kernels by using `-DCUTLASS_LIBRARY_KERNELS` such as `s16816gemm*nt_align8`",
